    "chunk_text": "& ic gehyrde heora Witodlice Ysrahela bearna clypung com to Gode, & ic geseah heora geswencednysse, \u00fee hy fram Ac cum; ic sende \u00fee to Faraone, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u ut al\u00e6de min folc, Israhela bearn, of Egypta lande. & \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Moyses to Gode: Hw\u00e6t eom ic \u00fe\u00e6t ic ga to Pharaone & ut al\u00e6dende Israhela bearn of \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe he to hym: Ic beo mid \u00fee, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u h\u00e6fst to tacne \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fee sende; \u00feonne \u00feu ut al\u00e6tst min folc \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 Moyses to hym: Nu ic ga to Israhela bearnum & ic secge him, Eowera f\u00e6dera God me \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 God to Moyse: IC EOM SE \u00feE EOM, cw\u00e6\u00f0 he; Sege \u00feus Israhela bearnum: SE \u00feE IS, me & eft cw\u00e6\u00f0 God to Moyse: Sege \u00feas \u00f0ing Israhela bearnum: Drihten ure f\u00e6dera God, Abrahames & ic cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ic eow ut al\u00e6de of Egypta geswencednysse on \u00fe\u00e6t land \u00fee Chananeus on is, & & hi gehyra\u00f0 \u00feine stemne; \u00feu g\u00e6st inn & \u00fea yldestan of Israhela folce to Egypta cyninge, & cwyst to Ac ic wat \u00fe\u00e6t Egypta cyngc eow ne forl\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t ge faron, buton \u00feurh strange hand. So\u00felice ic astrecce myne hand & slea Egypta land on eallum mynum wundrum \u00fee ic wyrce on heora & ic sylle \u00f0yson folce gyfe beforan \u00f0am Egyptyscan folce, & \u00feonne gyt ut fara\u00f0, ne fare ge Ac \u00fea Israhelyscan wif bidda\u00fe \u00e6",
